---

Task board

task-board-core, task-card, task-detail, and task-board are a clean-room
task board for a CRM. The arrangement was observed in an unlicensed
kanban mock (a public social post of a Dribbble-style board and a task
detail drawer). No source, markup, copy, colors, icons, photos, or assets
were copied. Columns, priorities, categories, and labels are props.
Spanish is the default chrome. taskBoardLabelsEn is the English set.
The catalog demo is Cooperativa Lumen, a fictional workshop. The people,
dates, and files are invented. view-kanban remains the schema board
inside multi-view. The card reuses the host Avatar and priority-badge.
The board reuses search-field and segmented-control. The sheet is the
host sheet. Answer no if the CLI asks to overwrite a primitive the host
already has. The items ship no theme.

