Agenda

agenda-core, agenda-event, agenda-detail, and agenda are a clean-room
time-grid agenda for a CRM. The arrangement was observed in an unlicensed
calendar mock (a public social post of a week dashboard). No source, markup,
copy, colors, icons, photos, or assets were copied. Views, categories, time
zone, and labels are props. Spanish is the default chrome. agendaLabelsEn is
the English set. The default zone is America/Mexico_City, the week starts on
Monday, and formats use es-MX. Time zones reuse the existing date-range
helpers. The catalog demo is Estudio Cálamo, a fictional workshop. The
people, rooms, and dates are invented. view-calendar remains the date-field
month inside multi-view. The block reuses the host button, switch, sheet,
tabs, and scroll area. Answer no if the CLI asks to overwrite a primitive
the host already has. The items ship no theme.

